request_examples:
获取指定名字的网络对象列表，查询条件：name为testA和testB
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups?_method=GET
[
{
"name": "testA"
},
{
"name": "testB"
}
]

新建一个网络对象，类型为IP地址，名字为testB，ip地址为1.1.1.1
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups
{
"ipRanges": [
{
"start": "1.1.1.1"
}
],
"businessType": "IP",
"name": "testB"
}

批量删除指定为testA和testB名字的网络对象
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups?_method=DELETE
[
{
"name": "testA"
},
{
"name": "testB"
}
]

增量修改指定名字为testB的网络对象，修改ip地址为：2.2.2.2，其他属性值不变
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups/testB
{
"ipRanges": [
{
"start": "2.2.2.2"
}
]
}

全量修改指定名字的网络对象，name为testA，类型为IP地址，ip地址为1.1.1.2，其他属性值使用默认值
PUT https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups/testA
{
"ipRanges": [
{
"start": "1.1.1.2"
}
],
"businessType": "IP",
"name": "testA"
}

增量更新链路探测配置test，修改ARP探测目标地址1为192.168.1.3
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/linkdetects/test
{
"arp": {
"address1": "192.168.1.3"
}
}

批量修改链路探测配置test1、test2，修改test1的ARP探测目标地址1为192.168.1.2，修改test2的DNS目标地
址1为192.168.2.2
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/linkdetects
[
{
"arp": {
"address1": "192.168.1.2"
},
"name": "test1"
},
{
"dns": {
"address1": "192.168.2.2"
},
"name": "test2"
}
]

