request_examples:
查询后台链路探测配置test1、test2的状态
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/status/linkdetect/page?_method=get
[
{
"name": "test1"
},
{
"name": "test2"
}
]

服务器识别高级配置
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/advancedconfig
{
"autoIdentifyEnable": true,
"sensitiveDataEnable": true,
"customEnable": false,
"ipGroups": {}
}

将服务器IP：192.168.110.1添加到忽略服务器列表
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/ignoredserver
{
"ip": "192.168.110.1"
}

将服务器IP：192.168.110.11和192.168.110.111批量添加到忽略服务器列表
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/ignoredserver
[
{
"ip": "192.168.110.11"
},
{
"ip": "192.168.110.111"
}
]

批量删除忽略服务器数据，IP为192.168.110.11和192.168.110.111
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/ignoredserver?_method=DELETE
[
{
"ip": "192.168.110.11"
},
{
"ip": "192.168.110.111"
}
]

获取网络对象敏感数据详情
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/ipgroups/sensitivepages?_method=GET
[
{
"iplist": [
"192.168.1.1"
]
}
]

批量忽略敏感数据详情，对应的敏感数据autoId为3和4，autoId可以使用获取敏感数据详情API去查看
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/ignoredpages
[
{
"autoId": 3
},
{
"autoId": 4
}

批量删除被忽略敏感数据详情，对应的敏感数据autoId为3和4，autoId可以使用获取敏感数据详情API去查看
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/netidentify/ignoredpages?_method=DELETE
[
{
"autoId": 3
},
{
"autoId": 4
}
]

