批量修改黑白名单
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/whiteblacklist
[
{
"description": "baidu",
"enable": true,
"url": "www.baidu.com",
"type": "WHITE"
}
]

批量添加封锁攻击者IP，添加源ip192.168.1.2、192.168.1.3，封锁时间为3天
POST https://192.168.1.1/api/batch/v1/namespaces/public/blockip
{
"srcIP": [
"192.168.1.2",
"192.168.1.3"
],
"ipType": "SRC",
"blockTime": "3d"
}

修改自动封锁攻击者时间为1天
PATCH https://192.168.1.1/api/v1/namespaces/public/blockiptime
{
"blockTime": "1d"
}
